@startuml
' ===== loan-system R1 概念模型（翻译自 raw/requirements-register.md）=====
' 翻译位: ZCode/GLM 2026-08-26; 覆盖: FIELD-001~003, RULE-001~004, FLOW-001~002, BR-002
' v3 (2026-08-27): D-B 裁决重构——单据流程状态与审批结果状态拆分为两个独立维度;
'   OrderStatus 六态减为四态(approved/rejected 移出, 转审批结果属性维度), CreditDecision 增至三值并挂接。

class Borrower {
  +id : String
  +name : String
  +id_number : String
  +phone : String
  +income : Decimal
  +employer : String
  +position : String
}

class LoanOrder {
  +id : String
  +amount : Decimal
  +term_months : Integer
  +purpose : LoanPurpose
  +interest_rate : Decimal
  +status : OrderStatus
}

class CreditResult {
  +score : Integer
  +approved_amount : Decimal
  +approved_rate : Decimal
  +decision : CreditDecision
  +decision_reason : String
}

' 单据流程状态维度(D-B 裁决: 仅流程态; 审批结果不在此维度)
enum OrderStatus {
  draft
  pending
  active
  closed
}
enum LoanPurpose {
  renovation
  education
  travel
  medical
}
' 审批结果状态维度(D-B 裁决: 三值, 独立标签持久化; under_review=待审核/审批未出结果)
enum CreditDecision {
  under_review
  approved
  rejected
}

' @disjoint: OrderStatus_draft, OrderStatus_pending, OrderStatus_active, OrderStatus_closed
' @disjoint: LoanPurpose_renovation, LoanPurpose_education, LoanPurpose_travel, LoanPurpose_medical
' @disjoint: CreditDecision_under_review, CreditDecision_approved, CreditDecision_rejected
' @required: LoanOrder.amount, LoanOrder.term_months, Borrower.id_number, Borrower.phone
' @pattern: Borrower.id_number = ^[0-9]{17}[0-9X]$
' @pattern: Borrower.phone = ^1[0-9]{10}$
' 注解说明(RULE-003): 用途枚举4类互斥 —— 本注解行即 RULE-003 在模型层的承接（对照静态评估发现的丢失缺陷）
' 注解说明(FLOW-001/D-B): 单据状态四态互斥; 审批结果(approved/rejected)是单据属性维度由 CreditDecision 承载,
'   原始需求将两个状态体系混淆——拆分依据见 review/E41 D-B 附记
' 注解说明(RULE-002/Z4): @required 四字段=Z4 裁决"全必填"(金额/期限/身份证/电话); @pattern 正则取国标默认
'   (身份证 GB 11643 十八位; 手机号十一位)——外部标准引用(Z_伪), 可复议; 草稿保存同触校验(TA2-04)为触发时机
'   语义, 归实现层与 R4 场景库, 不由 SHACL 承载

Borrower "1" --> "0..*" LoanOrder : places
LoanOrder "1" --> "0..1" CreditResult : hasDecision

' ===== 人工裁决记录（裁决事实源=review/E41-人工决策记录-S4.md）=====
' @decision: FLOW-002 = 原始需求歧义确认; MVP 按最简原则忽略人工处理环节(自动审批即生效) —— 采纳 US/design 侧语义
' @decision: RULE-004 = 费率定位为外部系统衔接点(MVP 退化固定值); Z2 默认值由实现侧配置承载
' @decision: FIELD-002 = borrower 关联为外部系统对接点, MVP 简化设计
' @decision: D-B = 两状态维度拆分(单据流程四态+审批结果三值CreditDecision); closed统一终态, 审批结果为属性非状态
@enduml
